    "text": "<p>In the following sequence of reactions a compound <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>,</mo></math> (molecular formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>12</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> ) with a straight chain structure gives a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> carboxylic acid. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> is :</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">A</mi><mfrac><msub><mi>LiAlH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">B</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mtext>&#160;Oxidation&#160;</mtext></mover><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></math> carboxylic acid</p>",
